abstract: >-
  Project website for the Urban Climate Health Nexus (UCH-Nexus) consortium,
  publicly branded REACH Nexus. A five-year (2026–2030) Brazilian–Dutch
  research consortium funded by NWO and FAPESP under the Merian Fund
  Cooperation Brazil – The Netherlands 2024 call on extreme heat and water
  events and their effects on urban health.
